{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>With a high hand.</b> With intent." "<b>Who reviles.</b> One who blasphemes, as in ״וְהָיְתָה חֶרְפָּה וּגְדוּפָה״ (Ezekiel 5), ״אֲשֶׁר גִּדְּפוּ נַעֲרֵי מֶלֶךְ אַשּׁוּר״ (Isaiah 37). And our Sages further expounded from here: for one who blesses [i.e., curses] the Name, his punishment is excision (Keritot 7)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:05.602958048Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}